			"Message": "refactor(Output): Prettify ESBuild configuration and plugins\n\nReformat the entire Output build pipeline configuration from minified single-line JavaScript into readable, multi-line ES6+ syntax. This affects the core ESBuild entry point, the VS Code bundling logic, exclusion lists, and the extensive suite of transform plugins (Inject, Replace, Rewrite, Polyfill) used to adapt the upstream Editor source for the Land environment.\n\nNo logic changes were made; this is strictly a formatting pass to improve maintainability and diff readability for future development.",
